{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"meetdeet-2012-deet-science2-12","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2012,"subject":"chemistry","number":12,"points":2,"unitId":"electro","unitLabel":"산화·환원·전기화학","topic":"전지·표준환원·환원전위","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["electro"],"stem":"그림은 2개의 반쪽 전지를 연결한 전지이고, 25°C에서 이 전지의\n전위차는 0.602V이다. 이때 왼쪽 전지의 Cl−의 몰농도는 a M이다. \n다음은 각 반쪽 전지의 반응식과 표준 환원 전위이다.\nAg+(aq)+e− ⇄  Ag(s)\nEo=0.799V\nAgCl(s)+e− ⇄  Ag(s)+Cl−(aq)\nEo=0.222V\n이 전지에 대한 설명으로 옳은 것만을 <보기>에서 있는 대로 고른 \n것은? \n<보 기>\nㄱ. a는 1.00보다 크다.\nㄴ. 오른쪽 전지의 Ag+ 몰농도가 ―\n10(0.222−0.799)/0.0592\nM이면 \na\n전위차는 0이 된다. \nㄷ. 왼쪽 전지에 소량의 고체 KCl을 가하면 전위차는 증가한다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016","t017"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02","fig-03","fig-04","fig-05","fig-06"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t018"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t019"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t020"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t021"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t022"]}],"answer":3,"acceptedAnswers":[3],"answerStatus":"source-text","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":453,"height":24,"region":0,"bbox":[62.28,5.915,181.2,9.6],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t001"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2012-deet-science2-12/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":409,"height":24,"region":0,"bbox":[59.48,27.115,163.6,9.6],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t002"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2012-deet-science2-12/02.webp"},{"id":"fig-03","width":553,"height":365,"region":0,"bbox":[59.48,50.715,221.2,146.0],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2012-deet-science2-12/03.webp"},{"id":"fig-04","width":575,"height":35,"region":0,"bbox":[29.48,235.115,230.0,14.0],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t004","t005"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet